# This directory is a placeholder for future Protobuf service definitions.
#
# When adding proto files:
#   1. Follow the package convention: stellabill.<service>.<version>
#      e.g.  package stellabill.billing.v1;
#   2. Uncomment the proto module in buf.yaml.
#   3. Uncomment the generator plugins in buf.gen.yaml.
#   4. See docs/buf-conventions.md for the full style guide.
